{
  "version": "2.1.0",
  "$schema": "https://docs.oasis-open.org/sarif/sarif/v2.1.0/errata01/os/schemas/sarif-schema-2.1.0.json",
  "runs": [
    {
      "tool": {
        "driver": {
          "name": "grype",
          "version": "0.115.0",
          "informationUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
          "rules": [
            {
              "id": "CVE-2023-31486-perl-base",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2023-31486 medium vulnerability for perl-base package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "HTTP::Tiny before 0.083, a Perl core module since 5.13.9 and available standalone on CPAN, has an insecure default TLS configuration where users must opt in to verify certificates."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2023-31486",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2023-31486\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: perl-base\nVersion: 5.34.0-3ubuntu1.7\nFix Version: \nType: deb\nLocation: /var/lib/dpkg/status\nData Namespace: ubuntu:distro:ubuntu:22.04\nLink: [CVE-2023-31486](https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2023-31486)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2023-31486**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| medium  | perl-base  | 5.34.0-3ubuntu1.7  |   | deb  | /var/lib/dpkg/status  | ubuntu:distro:ubuntu:22.04  | [CVE-2023-31486](https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2023-31486)  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:deb/ubuntu/perl-base@5.34.0-3ubuntu1.7?arch=amd64\u0026distro=ubuntu-22.04\u0026upstream=perl"
                ],
                "security-severity": "8.1"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-11856-curl",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactDirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-11856 medium vulnerability for curl package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Successfully using libcurl to do a transfer to a specific HTTP origin\n(`hostA`) with **Digest** authentication and then changing the origin to a\ndifferent one (`hostB`) for a second transfer, reusing the same handle, makes\nlibcurl wrongly pass on the  `Authorization:` header field meant for `hostA`,\nto `hostB`."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2026-11856",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-11856\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: curl\nVersion: 7.81.0-1ubuntu1.25\nFix Version: \nType: deb\nLocation: /var/lib/dpkg/status\nData Namespace: ubuntu:distro:ubuntu:22.04\nLink: [CVE-2026-11856](https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2026-11856)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-11856**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| medium  | curl  | 7.81.0-1ubuntu1.25  |   | deb  | /var/lib/dpkg/status  | ubuntu:distro:ubuntu:22.04  | [CVE-2026-11856](https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2026-11856)  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:deb/ubuntu/curl@7.81.0-1ubuntu1.25?arch=amd64\u0026distro=ubuntu-22.04"
                ],
                "security-severity": "9.8"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-11856-libcurl4",
